# 10. Conditional Joint Form Density

Conditional on

[
(F_i,X_i),
]

the joint density factorizes.

[
g_i(b,c|f)
==========

\prod_j
P(B_{ij}=b_j|f)
\prod_r
P(C_{ir}=c_r|f).
]

Evaluate all probabilities in log space.

